# INVBACK.KEY - a key script of INVWIN (SRC/WIN/INVWIN.C) over the serial
# link to INVSERV, run by TEST/WIN/winser.sh on the data
# TEST/KEYS/SEED.REQ and TEST/KEYS/RLLONG.REQ seed, sixty-three items, a
# list longer than a window: ESC back to a list on a link whose requests
# are slow, where the list opens with the one request of its first page.
# From a row two pages down, Record > Parts and ESC: the first page shows
# with its first row selected, the row left not being on it, and not the
# last row looked at.  From the third row, on the first page, the same
# keeps that row.  Log-out and the end from the login dialog.  The
# password goes in key by key, so that the script holds it nowhere for
# winser.sh's memory searches, which follow each ITEM GET, a scoped
# screen's for its title.  Every mode of Windows writes
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVSERB.SNP.
T ADMIN
K TAB
K SHIFT-R E T R O 1 9 8 6
K ENTER PGDN PGDN DOWN ALT-C P
K ESC
S FIRST
K DOWN DOWN ALT-C P
K ESC
S KEPT
K ALT-F L
K ESC
S GONE
